@startuml
!include _seq.iuml
title Sequência - Backup e Sair (UC26, UC03)
actor Usuário as U
participant "Tela (app.js → api.js)" as T
participant "API REST\nBackupControle\nAcessoControle" as S
participant BackupServico as C
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
== Backup ==
U -> T : clicar em "Backup"
T -> S : API 8.1  POST /api/backup\n→ BackupControle.fazerBackup()
S -> C : fazerBackup()
C -> DB : SELECT * de cada tabela\n(uma transação, foto consistente)
C -> C : gravar backup/confeitasys-AAAAMMDD-HHMMSS.sql\n(comandos INSERT)
S --> T : {arquivo}
T --> U : "Backup salvo em ..."
== Sair ==
U -> T : clicar em "Sair"
T -> S : API 1.2  POST /api/logout\n→ AcessoControle.logout()
S -> S : Sessoes.encerrar(token)
S --> T : 200 {ok}
T -> T : apagar token (localStorage)
T --> U : tela de login
@enduml
